# OrgResource workflow

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and its quality gate. For each coherent task, select the executor, model, reasoning effort and verification depth from the [GOAT routing skill](../../.agents/skills/orgresource-goat/SKILL.md). Use deterministic tools for exact checks.

Load the matching repository Superpowers skill for planning, implementation, debugging, review or verification. Use only available models and authorized delegation. Keep evidence tied to the exact source and acceptance scope.
